==============================================================================
SIGNED PAIRWISE FLOOR VIA THE MODULUS-n CUT OBSTRUCTION  monad-S711
==============================================================================
A cut is n-grid FEASIBLE if none of its relative speeds is 0 mod n.
If a feasible cut exists, t = 1/n certifies Gstar >= 1/n immediately.
Exact search is run only on the NO-N-CUT obstruction class.

